    {
      "id": "review-fa7fd1b41bbf-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "RB6-1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/spec_binding.ts:115 将原有 binding_incomplete 分支重新分类，却没有实现验收指定的最终 fallback：最终 return 的 missing 仍必定为空，因为非空数组已在前面的分支返回。新条件还会把一个完整 binding 加一个孤立路径的输入改成 binding_missing，超出了“没有恰好一个 binding”的目标范围。应保留已有完整 binding 时的 binding_incomplete 分类，明确处理零 binding 的非空输入，并增加完整 pair 加孤立路径的回归断言；当前修改的测试不能证明最终 fallback 得到修复。",
      "anchor": "sha256:c50f66562d7afaaa3fb835875672abcc9f4d642e5ec7d8d09aedba632c741c06",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "scope_hint 为 [\"docs/specs/a.spec.md\",\"docs/specs/archive/a.spec.md\",\"docs/specs/b.spec.md\"]：bindings.length 为 1，missing 为 [\"docs/specs/archive/b.spec.md\"]，新代码因两侧均非空返回 binding_missing，旧代码返回 binding_incomplete；任何 missing 非空的输入也都无法到达验收指定的最终 return。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_plan.ts:projectBatchPlan",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/kernel/spec_binding.ts:inspectSpecBinding"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "RB6-1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    }
  ],
